{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19160","headline":"同乐天送令狐相公赴东都留守 · 刘禹锡","name":"同乐天送令狐相公赴东都留守","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"尚书劒履出明光，居守旌旗赴洛阳。\n世上功名兼将相，人间声价是文章。\n衙门晓辟分天仗，宾幕初开辟省郎。\n从发坡头向东望，春风处处有甘棠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19160.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19160","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}